flowchart TD
    A[Application + documents] --> B[Extraction per document<br/>doc_type, fields, confidence<br/>unknown / failed / timeout -> OTHER 0.00]
    B --> C[Select documents: lowest doc_id per classified type<br/>address proof = lowest of ELECTRICITY_BILL, BANK_STATEMENT, DRIVING_LICENCE]
    C --> D[Usable field = present, non-empty, confidence >= min_field_confidence]
    D --> E[Evaluate ALL rules, no short-circuit<br/>skip a rule whose field is not usable]
    E --> R1[R1 DOCUMENT_MISSING]
    E --> R2[R2 DOCUMENT_TYPE_MISMATCH]
    E --> R3[R3 LOW_EXTRACTION_CONFIDENCE]
    E --> R4[R4 AGE_BELOW_18]
    E --> R5[R5 PAN_INVALID]
    E --> R6[R6 PAN_MISMATCH]
    E --> R7[R7 DOB_MISMATCH]
    E --> R8[R8 AADHAAR_MISMATCH]
    E --> R9[R9 NAME_MISMATCH score < 0.75]
    E --> R10[R10 SANCTIONS_MATCH]
    E --> R11[R11 NAME_MISMATCH_MINOR 0.75 <= score < 0.90]
    E --> R12[R12 DOCUMENT_EXPIRED]
    E --> R13[R13 ADDRESS_PROOF_STALE]
    E --> R14[R14 ADDRESS_MISMATCH]
    E --> R15[R15 SANCTIONS_POSSIBLE_MATCH]
    E --> R16[R16 PEP_MATCH]
    E --> R17[R17 DUPLICATE_CUSTOMER]
    R1 & R2 & R3 & R4 & R5 & R6 & R7 & R8 & R9 & R10 & R11 & R12 & R13 & R14 & R15 & R16 & R17 --> F{Any of R4-R10?}
    F -- yes --> REJ[REJECT -> AUTO_REJECTED<br/>risk + re-KYC empty]
    F -- no --> G{Any of R1-R3, R11-R17?}
    G -- yes --> REV[REVIEW -> IN_REVIEW<br/>risk + re-KYC computed]
    G -- no --> H{risk_category}
    H -- LOW / MEDIUM --> AA[APPROVE -> AUTO_APPROVED<br/>open account]
    H -- HIGH --> PC[APPROVE -> PENDING_CHECKER]
